[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一次審査、通ってたぞ。おめでとう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おぉっ！　さすが三峰！\r\nいやー、いけると思ったんだよねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "余裕そうだな\r\nもっとドキドキしてるかと思ってたのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁ三峰だからねぇ\r\nこんなところであっさり落ちない落ちない！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやって、きちんと自分を信じられるのも大切なことだ\r\n忘れないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おおー、プロデューサーも思わず\r\n名言言っちゃうぐらい喜んでるー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……茶化すなよ。あと、過信も禁物だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、冗談だって！　良い言葉だと思うよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それに、さすがの三峰だって\r\n身の程弁えないようなことはしないから安心して！",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかってるならいいけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それにしてもさ、『審査通過』なんてアイドルっぽいよね！\r\n本当に、アイドルになったんだねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今頃か？　これまで仕事もやってきただろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それはそうなんだけど……１歩進んだ感があるっていうかさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰でもちゃんとアイドルやれてるし、\r\nまわりの人からも許されてるんだなって思えて、嬉しくて",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう自覚が湧いてきたのはいいことだな\r\n……でも、喜ぶのはまだ早い。この先もあるんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "次の審査も頑張ろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "これで終わりじゃないんだもんね\r\nまだ次があるんなら──頑張らないと！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700101/7007001010090"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]